-dense-linear-order-qe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}\">\\(T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"82293682c9179b16\" href=\"?note=82293682c9179b16\" title=\"17-df-dense-linear-order\">17-df-dense-linear-order</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>，解释语言为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{&lt;}\">\\(L_{&lt;}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}(T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Complete}(T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary 1.5.4，印刷 p.54。QE 将每个句子化为最多以一个无用自由变量表示的量词自由式；一变量下原子式只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0=v_0\">\\(v_0=v_0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0&lt;v_0\">\\(v_0&lt;v_0\\)</span>，其真值在所有 DLO 中相同。有理数模型保证一致性，因此句子或其否定恰有一个为理论后承。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-dense-linear-order","status":"resolved","id":"82293682c9179b16","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe","status":"resolved","id":"cbf4219cf8e62a